{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f3b015c156ab9728c7a9437d6480d45e6e86fc7a7d2107a71e24b5e8b0869516", "ja": "（今日は、衣装屋さんにおつかいだ。\nお願いしていた衣装ができているはずだけど……）", "zh": "（今天我来服装店跑腿。\n之前委托的服装应该做好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cbc820c5eb664fc796c0976c124eb2572a617afb78c8115ff1076fc20d22bbac", "ja": "……はい、はい。これで間違いありません。\nありがとうございます。それじゃ……。", "zh": "……是的，是的。就是这件没错。\n谢谢。那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a0efaab712249d58fb88fef3919233ce98452ab97c4d88339a32036a669c22b2", "ja": "（もともとバレエの衣装屋さんだからかな、\nひどく場違いな感じがする……早く出よう）", "zh": "（可能因为这里其实是芭蕾舞服装店，\n感觉我不太适合这里……赶快离开吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "e8c883131e621270e8fdb194be9afab4188bbd871339846ed3a8cb7ac307def7", "ja": "うわ～っ、カワイイ～っ！！\nそれ、何の衣装！？", "zh": "哇～好可爱～！！\n那是什么服装！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1004_p", "source_sha256": "77c583ecae40fdbe5babc360458f6ed8da604ecbd02ab1e1bf62c562b1fde714", "ja": "えっ？　……わっ！？", "zh": "咦？\n……哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "6416f1fcc5067c50560fb714d4740cab2d1b8ca6bd43bcfe17215dc594cca696", "ja": "ううっ、フリフリだぁ～……♪\nスカートもヒラヒラして、アイドルみたいっ。", "zh": "唔唔，是荷叶边～♪\n而且裙子也轻飘飘的，好像偶像一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b7c80a479eb5e54cea9bd5b89374bae9528cc3e4bc52ef125f4282299e8544d5", "ja": "（お、お客さんかな？\nそれにしても、ずいぶん元気な子だな……）", "zh": "（是、是客人吗？\n不过她感觉真有活力……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "84aebef72164bbbbaf63349a310c889e837043716863b417a9911da2e7d239b5", "ja": "バレエの衣装に似てるけど、チュチュじゃないよね？\nねね、これ何に使うの！？", "zh": "虽然很像芭蕾舞的服装，但这不是芭蕾舞裙对吧？\n欸欸，这是用来做什么的啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "af88c607471a7c61b44614c83c29e6615bc208c36eac4d9dcbcc23ca4b5e45da", "ja": "ああ、これはアイドルの衣装だよ。\n今日は新しい衣装を受け取りに来たんだ。", "zh": "哦，这是偶像的服装啦。\n我今天是来拿新服装的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "4e6a9e650e2512c1a280e613b919d31a2309f798d76dbc7642637631aa44aaf6", "ja": "えっ、本当にアイドルの衣装なんだ！？\nすごーい！", "zh": "咦，真的是偶像的服装啊！？\n好厉害～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "d1742af60a07b53e2d576273692a7bf5f31aebb90c23496e63aabcfae5a3db4b", "ja": "やっぱり、私もこういう衣装着なくちゃダメかな……\n目立つのって、大事だよね！", "zh": "果然，我也该穿这种服装吧……\n毕竟抢眼的打扮是很重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "21edeb9c6f373ba5623d37e2f20222c9b8d2dfe66688ee99161c7086fedccdb9", "ja": "へえ。君はアイドルが好きなんだね？", "zh": "这样啊，你喜欢偶像是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "14cbf1fc90378faf2c6ef048b83a87f194488f2b1a3cc434bd545d355bf0d4f0", "ja": "うん！\n私、アイドル大好きっ！", "zh": "嗯！\n我最喜欢偶像了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "d0746ebf60f20a99d3b9db8e188b840f8d8c265b4fc974cdc45d9e7ecbc5b527", "ja": "アイドルっていいよね～！　可愛いし、\nなんかキラキラーってしてて、女子力高そうだし♪", "zh": "偶像很棒～！既可爱，\n又闪闪发光的，感觉女子力也很高♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "31a910008f8f00246ff1c8dab0e8a0b4a463f87f93bd44e28e35c84cac1cf247", "ja": "それに、とにかく見てると元気になるっ！\nそれって、すごいコトだよね？？", "zh": "而且看着她们时就是会涌现活力！\n这很厉害对吧？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "593c9e39d674953fa1a243182a91d213ffe5f359cf7d8acdbccea4acc4899644", "ja": "あ、ああ。\n本当に、すごいコトだと思うよ！", "zh": "呃，是呀。\n我觉得真的很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "74aac3afe0e2cfb25f6f20231dc06c9df9489702d1663a6fc47d78096d297ec0", "ja": "ところで、この店にいるってことは……\n君はバレエをやってるのかな？", "zh": "话说，你会来这家店……\n意思是你有在跳芭蕾舞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "22a62241aacaf32a5cf7dd0bab34f5a82539ec409e26c5c55f180009c4118702", "ja": "あ、そうそう。\nお姉ちゃんがやってて、私も小さい頃に始めたんだ！", "zh": "啊，对啊对啊。\n先是我姊姊在练，我也从小就开始学了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "ddb1d3a0dde4260e2cfa2872de0e876f71a3bef8f09f6ca331851ea341f4d996", "ja": "でも、お姉ちゃんは、外国のバレエ団に行くことに\nなって……。その時に言われたんだよね。", "zh": "不过姊姊后来去了国外的芭蕾舞团……\n那时她跟我说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "9401847b87f4fe26026c8267b0a8165b4b5d8993d1b0f8165a467ddfadbd420d", "ja": "「海美ちゃんも、自分の夢を叶えてね」って。", "zh": "「海美也要实现自己的梦想喔」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5d8c9a2a2091fbe8eb955e5df7d5784802fede490883f74896a02c7b69f65268", "ja": "夢……。", "zh": "梦想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "488a4ef3a8e437e40e4f0fc62b94598a3f98ad090e098ac296708141deb43643", "ja": "最初は、何のことかわかんなかったけど……\nこの前、ポスターを見て思い出したの！ほら、あれっ！", "zh": "一开始我还不懂她的意思……\n但之前我看到海报就想起来了！就是那张海报！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f432b8c752e5447d1ebde610924a4e5f6eb2bc00a5c7cbd69d5984a876137c2c", "ja": "（って、あれは衣装を借りた時に貼らせてもらった、\n39プロジェクトのポスター……！）", "zh": "（咦，那是之前来借服装时，\n店家让我贴的39PROJECT海报……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "e19b9ae7b7a845789f0dd3778439cba7e1ef7780407637d5f916c36bd5bdc4ee", "ja": "私、ずっとバレエを習ってたんだけど。\n本当は、アイドルになりたかったんだーって！", "zh": "我想起了虽然自己一直在学芭蕾舞，\n但其实是想当偶像的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1024_p", "source_sha256": "4346d04a22c8bdfa5c0c40e242a650c5e14e2e62b176e6949d4a2ff4481cd029", "ja": "（なんて楽しそうに夢を語る子なんだろう。\nそれに、人を引きつけるこの笑顔……）", "zh": "（她说到梦想时看起来多么开心啊。\n而且她有着能吸引人心的笑容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "d28e4b904092fc0cbe59b4ae41b0965696f88b07e81b9e6a61828ebdf8794d15", "ja": "お姉ちゃんが自分の夢を叶えたみたいに、\n私も、私の夢を叶えたいっ！　叶えるっ！", "zh": "就像姊姊实现她的梦想那样，\n我也想实现自己的梦想！我要实现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "973c3ea81a3102b0893134ce09acba89c7b4920b87d3973bf5c05520b88668ec", "ja": "それで、オーディション用の衣装をどうしようって、\n思ってたとこなんだ～。えへへっ♪", "zh": "所以我现在是在思考\n甄选时的服装该穿什么啦～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f05601d6c6920f9531006f72a912941238ca0450f821faced5421bce8b3bebec", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "f55d982d10cb201f5f711e710aa355f48a23ccfc20ef4cec05dfcca68bc34bae", "ja": "衣装見せてくれて、ありがと！　参考になっちゃった！\nそれじゃ、またねーっ☆", "zh": "谢谢你让我看服装！很值得参考！\n那么再见啦──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_1029", "source_sha256": "476cdd55e7cf314bf178d6aa51c3e4200db536e4cb68e8c20018ea1a8f89d78d", "ja": "ちょっと待った！", "zh": "等一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5d790ea2739218510a273a4181ad6d59fed26ec61b6319d3039ca9513e29aa58", "ja": "ちょっと待った！　君、39プロジェクトの\nオーディションを受けるんだよね？", "zh": "等一下！\n同学，你要参加39PROJECT的甄选对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2001_029umi", "source_sha256": "a3b7ed6b1ec288f3bb953bfc8fc0d5c147ed57ec7bc7f9c5f3ea9430a272674e", "ja": "うん、そうだよ～。\n書類はもう送ったから、あとはオーディションだけ！", "zh": "嗯，对啊～\n报名资料已经送出去了，现在就等甄选当天了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "7ab226e18b1335f8cb9fae72013b848b52dc199f9154c1a638d824c42973f7ab", "ja": "俺はその、39プロジェクトのプロデューサーなんだ。\n君、39プロジェクトのアイドルにならないか？", "zh": "那个39PROJECT的制作人就是我。\n你要不要来当39PROJECT的偶像？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2003_029umi", "source_sha256": "a75d9fc9e93a017ca4445188c676c7da8a5f4889fe1feddf7fe7616a76c85748", "ja": "ん？　あれ？\n……なに、どういうこと？", "zh": "嗯？奇怪？\n……什么，怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "9c1e262276ec6ad69fbf668b63fd44f247cf562f68b7fc251b8696d204d20829", "ja": "言い方が悪かったかな……。俺は39プロジェクトの\nプロデューサーで、君をスカウトしてるんだ。", "zh": "说得不够清楚吗……我是39PROJECT的制作人，\n我想发掘你当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2006_029umi", "source_sha256": "25e47b4411cc435a5cb003fd76a8a21ebe13dc4327d733e73e986c919492433d", "ja": "39プロジェクトの……プロデューサー？\nスカウトって……わ、私を！！？", "zh": "39PROJECT的……制作人？\n你说发掘……我、我吗！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "fc6d5e8eface2b6e8307fa1ae9f7584605b5d71425966ffaec99692c8a3e47fa", "ja": "ああ。君も知ってのとおり、今度765プロから、\n新たに39人のアイドルがデビューする。", "zh": "嗯。正如你所知，\n这次765艺能会有39名新偶像出道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "f3488558a462a59dac10aeedd59fc6188d434649a89364cd37b1aa4b42b4af9d", "ja": "君には是非、そのうちの1人になってほしい。\nみんなに元気をあげるのに、ピッタリだと思う。", "zh": "我非常希望你能成为其中一人。\n我觉得你很适合加入，带给大家活力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2009_029umi", "source_sha256": "a04fc2fe461da37eb3d3ed176b9695ecb3fc8598237024cfaf5d61cf8974af1a", "ja": "……や、やる！　いや、やります！\n私にアイドル、やらせて！！", "zh": "……我、我要当！不、请给我这个机会！\n请给我当偶像的机会！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "8c907041da4acd4db3296b9b396f21b18c57e4fd80314aed4df13c1868f28c3b", "ja": "（本当に、表情がよく変わる子だな。\n見ていて飽きないぞ、これは……）", "zh": "（她的表情真的很丰富呢。\n让人百看不厌……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "47b3e4765c0530a9ef3f69b67c9329ebb85a3fe49fed7cdc65c9d13061e8a631", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう！\nこれからよろしくな。えっと……。", "zh": "是吗，谢谢你！\n今后请你多多指教了，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2012_029umi", "source_sha256": "fcfb12ed02950cc0dd80c07454f7f732a32e326f691df3cfcec726bc91e64b9a", "ja": "あっ、まだ名前言ってなかったね。私は、海美！\n海が美しいって書いて高坂海美だよ、プロデューサー！", "zh": "啊，还没有说过我的名字呢。我是海美！\n由来是「美丽的大海」，全名是高坂海美喔，制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2013_p", "source_sha256": "c74bd8d547a9a98cc59680f127fe10fed3d889d89760010261153010ac54a997", "ja": "海美……綺麗な、いい名前だな。\nこれからよろしくな、海美！", "zh": "海美……真是美丽的好名字呢。\n今后请多指教了，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2014_029umi", "source_sha256": "1cfdf0d479741a32f44073d12dca3e6d154035e411c266944bb233150a90aa93", "ja": "綺麗な名前だなんて、そんな～……\nえへへ♪", "zh": "居然说是美丽的名字，哪会啦～\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2015_029umi", "source_sha256": "b84e29b3236d06feddb490217bf86eaebc7d02089f2209b16739d1a7de766ef1", "ja": "私、新しい舞台に立つんだ……\nなんだか、すっごくワクワクしちゃうなーっ☆", "zh": "我要站上新的舞台了……\n感觉好兴奋喔──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_029umi_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_029umi_001_2016_p", "source_sha256": "6f65073541207c1bcf5c51d6616cb5e7b4afa0f1c696209e2f58357cb9c78948", "ja": "（高坂海美、か……面白い子に会えたぞ。\nたまにはおつかいも、いいかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（高坂海美是吗……我遇到了很有趣的孩子呢。\n偶尔出来跑腿也不错嘛！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
